{"v":4,"catch":"Ding Dong XL 是一款融入霓虹燈的單鍵街機遊戲。這是一種令人上癮的“再多一輪”得分攻擊，將測試您的反應能力。","desc":"當您嘗試避開障礙物、收集積分並粉碎有用的能量道具時，您會在屏幕頂部和底部之間的叮噹聲。盡可能地活下去！\n\n簡單的一鍵控制，只需按一下叮咚鍵就可以從上到下橫穿屏幕，反之亦然。等待適當的時機，不要擊中敵人。","publisher":"Adamvision Studios","release":"2022-01-20","genres":["街機","動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","葡萄牙文","俄文","韓文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/61047851042a377bb6911077b41dd304ed238c2565b39cf7d2bae110e178b34b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d5afbbed5b232267b5979d57831a20ead737dbc0aa8781ef4ecd69ed59674119.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3f6f33107b0d13844471b76aaebe56f271f14a4e8e682bab15f8c9875904ae14.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9f181d8051d7be690c7b0665320b26877a59bb866b0728ec63205b67367bc913.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9371f92a2ca3206f1baf3e88f622596243567a3927800287f9e9f10eec00de1f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7a97b15fdeb3c35f8a536b5819fb2a90cfdc372c6956b5bd07b7388947eb6a46.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b6d00da6e000","dlc":[]}